# HELP-E API key configuration. Copy this to `.env.local` and fill in
# YOUR keys. `.env.local` is git-ignored. Run scripts source this file.
#
# Three tenant slots in HELP-E:
#   MAIN  — chatbot's MAIN-tier calls (Agent 2 inference, Agent 5 response,
#           Agent P persona update). Big model.
#   JUDGE — MITI 4.2 + ESC judges. Big model. Often the same key/endpoint
#           as MAIN.
#   SIM   — user simulator (Mind-1, session_context). Small/mid model.
#   SMALL — small-tier per-turn agents (Agent 1, 3a, 3b, 3c, X, Q in v8).
#           Defaults to SIM endpoint if not set.
#
# Pick one provider per slot. The run scripts under `scripts/` set the
# URL + model name; you only fill in the keys here.
#
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local vLLM (no key required for the local endpoint)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Use scripts/run_v7_local_120b.sh / run_v8_local_120b.sh / etc.
# The MAIN/JUDGE keys can be the literal string "EMPTY".
# HELPE_MAIN_API_KEY="EMPTY"
# HELPE_JUDGE_API_KEY="EMPTY"

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Lightning AI (gpt-oss / llama-3.3 hosted) — get keys at https://lightning.ai
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Used by scripts/run_v*_lightning_70b.sh. Each tenant has its own key.
# HELPE_MAIN_API_KEY="<your-lightning-llama-3.3-70b-key>"
# HELPE_SIM_API_KEY="<your-lightning-gpt-oss-20b-key>"
# HELPE_JUDGE_API_KEY can default to MAIN if you're judging on the same model.

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Fireworks AI (gpt-oss-120b hosted) — get keys at https://fireworks.ai
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Used by scripts/run_v*_fireworks*.sh.
# HELPE_MAIN_API_KEY="<your-fireworks-key>"

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional: per-call-role token caps (only set if you hit truncation)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# HELPE_MAX_TOKENS_AGENT2_INFERENCE_V7=4000
# HELPE_MAX_TOKENS_AGENT5_RESPONSE_V7=3000
# HELPE_MAX_TOKENS_AGENT5_RESPONSE_V8=3000
# HELPE_MAX_TOKENS_MITI_JUDGE=2000
# HELPE_MAX_TOKENS_ESC_JUDGE=2500

# Optional: gpt-oss reasoning effort knob — "low" / "medium" / "high"
# Default "low" trims internal CoT for extraction tasks.
# HELPE_REASONING_EFFORT="low"

# Optional: v8 RAG tuning
# HELPE_V8_DENSE_MODEL="sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2"
# HELPE_V8_MMR_LAMBDA=0.5
# HELPE_V8_MMR_FETCH_K=20
